<view class="card">
  <view class="card-title">① 轨迹截图（必填）</view>
  <view class="hint">运动 App 里能看到整条路线的概览截图</view>
  <view class="pick-box" wx:if="{{!overview}}" bindtap="pickOverview">＋ 选择图片</view>
  <view wx:else class="preview-wrap">
    <image class="preview-img" src="{{overview}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="pickOverview" />
    <view class="preview-remove" catchtap="clearOverview">移除</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="card-title">② 街道级细节图（可选）</view>
  <view class="hint">概览图缩放过高、识别不准时，沿路线滑动截几张街道级图补传</view>
  <view class="detail-row" wx:for="{{details}}" wx:key="index">
    <image class="detail-thumb" src="{{item}}" mode="aspectFill" />
    <view class="detail-remove" catchtap="removeDetail" data-index="{{index}}">×</view>
  </view>
  <view class="pick-box small" wx:if="{{details.length < 9}}" bindtap="pickDetails">＋ 添加细节图（{{details.length}}/9）</view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="card-title">③ 订单详情截图（可选）</view>
  <view class="hint">用于提取开始时间/耗时/卡路里等概要，GPX/TCX 时间轴依赖它</view>
  <view class="pick-box" wx:if="{{!summary}}" bindtap="pickSummary">＋ 选择图片</view>
  <view wx:else class="preview-wrap">
    <image class="preview-img" src="{{summary}}" mode="aspectFit" bindtap="pickSummary" />
    <view class="preview-remove" catchtap="clearSummary">移除</view>
  </view>
</view>

<view class="card">
  <view class="card-title">辅助信息（可选）</view>
  <view class="field">
    <text class="field-label">城市</text>
    <input class="field-input" placeholder="如：深圳（可留空）" value="{{city}}" bindinput="onCity" />
  </view>
  <view class="field">
    <text class="field-label">途经路名</text>
    <input class="field-input" placeholder="如：深南大道,科苑南路（可留空）" value="{{roadNames}}" bindinput="onRoadNames" />
  </view>
  <view class="note">路名是强约束：提供后轨迹会尽量贴合指定道路，精度显著提升</view>
</view>

<view class="footer">
  <button class="btn-primary" bindtap="start" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">
    {{busy ? '识别中，可能需要 1-2 分钟' : '开始识别'}}
  </button>
  <view class="note err" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view>
</view>
